## 1. Architecture Overview

```
         ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │                  Application Layer                │
┌────────┴────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐│
│  Gateway_SWC    │  │ CanRouter_SWC │  │  EthManager_SWC ││
│  (CAN routing)  │  │ (signal gw)   │  │  (SOME/IP)      ││
└────────┬────────┘  └───────┬───────┘  └────────┬────────┘│
         └──────────────────┬────────────────────┘         │
┌───────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
│                    RTE + E2E Wrapper
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│  Com / Dcm / Dem / EcuM / BswM / NvM / PduR / CanM
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│  CanIf / CanTp / LinIf / EthIf / SomeIpIf / SoAd / DoIP
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│  Can / Lin / Eth / Mcu / Dio / Port / Gpt / Wdg / Adc
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
```

## 2. MPU Partitioning

| Partition | SWCs | ASIL | Memory Region |
|:----------|:-----|:----:|:--------------|
| Partition 0 | Gateway_SWC | B | 0x0000_0000 - 0x0005_FFFF |
| Partition 1 | CanRouter_SWC | B | 0x0006_0000 - 0x0009_FFFF |
| Partition 2 | EthManager, DiagGateway | A | 0x000A_0000 - 0x000F_FFFF |
| Partition 3 | BSW Services | B | 0x0010_0000 - 0x001F_FFFF |

## 3. Safety Mechanisms

| ID | Mechanism | ASIL | Reaction |
|:---|:----------|:----:|:---------|
| SM-01 | Routing Table CRC | B | Safe Route |
| SM-02 | CAN Bus-Off Recovery | B | DTC + Retry |
| SM-03 | Eth Link Heartbeat | A | DTC + Fallback |
| SM-04 | Deadline Monitor | B | DEM Event |
| SM-05 | Secure Boot | B | Halt on Fail |
